 ## Background
-Voxelization optimization techniques have been developed to address the performance bottlenecks of early GPU-based voxelization methods. The use of stream output for deforming meshes and instancing for slicing was highlighted in *GPU Gems 3* [S1, unofficial]. The application of these techniques to global illumination, such as voxel cone tracing, was explored in the context of games like *Rise of Tomb Raider* and *The Tomorrow Children* [S2, unofficial]. The Min/Max Altitude Heightmap Optimization describes internal logic for updating per-column heightmaps on voxel addition or removal [S3, unofficial].
